===Etymology ===
From {{etyl|enm|en}} {{term|burjon|burjon, burioun|shoot, bud|lang=enm}}, from {{etyl|xno|en}} {{term|burjun|burjun, burgeon, burgon|lang=fro}}, from {{etyl|fro|en}} {{term|burjon||bud|lang=fro}}, from {{etyl|VL.|en}} {{term/t|la|*burrionem}}, accusative of {{term/t|la|*burrio}}, from {{etyl|LL.|en}} {{term|burra||wool, fluff|lang=la}} (presumably from the down covering certain buds).

